["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Iron Age Ireland sacral kingship Fianna currach opidum\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-ancients-爱尔兰铁器时代没有凯尔特人入侵-只有贸易和语言/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ef50c48b77dede87-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">52:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>爱尔兰铁器时代没有凯尔特人入侵，只有贸易和语言</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">传统说法认为凯尔特人带着铁器在公元前500年入侵爱尔兰，但考古几乎找不到外来移民的痕迹——凯尔特身份其实是青铜时代晚期海上贸易网络里慢慢长出来的语言共同体。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">考古</span><span class=\"tag\">爱尔兰</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The Battle of Stamford Bridge Explained berserk chape house carls Varangian Guard Doomsday Book\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-historyhit-斯坦福桥大捷被黑斯廷斯一笔勾销-考古刚找到战场/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cc50d2d1c5ba1e0e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">31:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>斯坦福桥大捷被黑斯廷斯一笔勾销，考古刚找到战场</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1066年9月，英王哈罗德四天急行军约200英里，全歼哈拉尔德·哈德拉达的维京大军；但这场足以奠定任何君主声望的胜利，几天后就被黑斯廷斯的惨败彻底抹去。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>13</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">维京时代</span><span class=\"tag\">1066年</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"394. Road To 9/11: Hijackers, CIA Failures, and America’s Darkest Day (Part 6) cock-up view of history muscle hijackers casing videotape the wall ghazia\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-09-empirehist-cia-提前数月警告-白宫为何还是没拦住-9-11/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1805b3753086ecbd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">46:16</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Empire 世界史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0909</span></div>\n<h2>CIA 提前数月警告，白宫为何还是没拦住 9/11</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">情报系统把战略预警做到了极致，但决策者可以选择无视——这是 9/11 前七个月真正的失败点。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">情报失灵</span><span class=\"tag\">组织决策</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"704. Roman Civil War: Master of the Republic (Part 4) proscription lictor tribunate adulescentulus carnifex Campus Martius\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-09-restishistory-苏拉用血洗罗马-却亲手为凯撒铺好了路/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4d082c6220b28920-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:10:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0909</span></div>\n<h2>苏拉用血洗罗马，却亲手为凯撒铺好了路</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">苏拉是第一个带兵打进罗马的人，他赢了内战、当上独裁官、又主动退位。但他打破的禁忌再也收不回来——凯撒说他是傻瓜，因为他交出了独裁权。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">罗马史</span><span class=\"tag\">内战</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"At The Money: Considering a Career Change? How About FINFLUENCER? finfluencer RIA Roth IRA cringe phase top of funnel W-2\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-09-mastersinbiz-做金融网红不是当网红-是把社媒当漏斗顶端/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7fb210b1031bb956-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">30:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0909</span></div>\n<h2>做金融网红不是当网红，是把社媒当漏斗顶端</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Tyler Gardner 从教师转行做理财顾问，再转做金融内容，做到 600 万粉丝。他的判断是：短视频只是漏斗顶端，真正的资产是你能自己拥有的邮件列表和长内容。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">个人品牌</span><span class=\"tag\">金融内容</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"5 Solo Founders Called In With Their Hardest Problem | Solo Founders Office Hours RL environment jobs to be done GMV ERP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-09-solofounders-单人创始人最缺的不是人手-是有人逼你说真话/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9f64dfbc7c597bfb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">47:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">单人创始人</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0909</span></div>\n<h2>单人创始人最缺的不是人手，是有人逼你说真话</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Julian 给五位单人创始人的诊断几乎都指向同一件事：没有联合创始人，你就失去了那个逼你面对「今天到底做了什么」的人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">单人创业</span><span class=\"tag\">早期融资</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"11 Marketing Rules every Creator needs to know: Kate Tolo bouncer ticket price yes and\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-09-colinsamir-把内容当夜店-算法是保安-你唯一的工作是让他放你进去/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ac1190aacdd40897-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">53:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Colin and Samir</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0909</span></div>\n<h2>把内容当夜店：算法是保安，你唯一的工作是让他放你进去</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Kate Tolo 用五年把 Brian Johnson 从 2000 粉做到千万粉，她的核心比喻是：算法是夜店保安，只在乎场内的人玩得开不开心，你失败一百次也没人看见。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">内容策略</span><span class=\"tag\">增长</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Can AI help us better predict the weather? numerical weather prediction GraphCast GenCast functional generative networks spaghetti plots load forecasting\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-09-deepmind-ai-预报飓风提前一周锁定五级-靠的是统计不是物理/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/64e94263145b97b2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"G\"><span class=\"dur\">44:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Google DeepMind</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0909</span></div>\n<h2>AI 预报飓风提前一周锁定五级，靠的是统计不是物理</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">传统数值预报靠解流体方程，AI 靠从历史天气里学统计规律。飓风 Melissa 在还是热带低压时就被模型以约 80% 置信度锁定为五级，比传统模型更早更狠。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 天气预测</span><span class=\"tag\">DeepMind</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Ashurbanipal cuneiform colophon Neo-Assyrian Sardanapalus Bisitun inscription\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-09-stuffmissed-亚述巴尼拔的图书馆-他既是暴君-也是最早的藏书家/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">37:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0909</span></div>\n<h2>亚述巴尼拔的图书馆：他既是暴君，也是最早的藏书家</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">亚述巴尼拔一边把敌国国王关进狗窝、逼人用祖先骨头做砖，一边建起人类最早的系统性图书馆，让《吉尔伽美什史诗》活到今天。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>12</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">历史</span><span class=\"tag\">考古</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Jared Diamond on Leaders, Luck, and Irreplaceability environmental Kuznets curve natural experiments Dvorak keyboard\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-09-tyler-没有不可替代的领袖-只有不可替代的运气/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2d90e9a992692a3e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">52:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Conversations with Tyler</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0909</span></div>\n<h2>没有不可替代的领袖，只有不可替代的运气</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">戴蒙德研究领袖五十年，结论是长期看没有哪个领袖不可替代——成吉思汗只是恰好生在两千年来最湿润的草原上，换个人也许一样。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">领导力</span><span class=\"tag\">历史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"When will average people feel AI’s impact? Engels’ pause Navier-Stokes Millennium Prize Problem\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-09-interconnects-ai-对普通人是舍入误差-扩散要五十年-反弹却等不了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2ea9ccfe0923b7a0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">8:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Interconnects</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0909</span></div>\n<h2>AI 对普通人是舍入误差：扩散要五十年，反弹却等不了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">工业革命给普通人便宜衣服和缝纫机，AI 目前只给普通人好玩的图片和更好的搜索——好处太间接，而政治反弹来得太快。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 扩散</span><span class=\"tag\">公众认知</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Who Grades the AI Models? | Ben Horowitz &amp; Rayan Krishnan held-out private benchmarks recursive self-improvement (RSI) reward hacking token maxing harness\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-09-a16z-公开榜单测不出模型真实能力-第三方评测才是刚需/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">39:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0909</span></div>\n<h2>公开榜单测不出模型真实能力，第三方评测才是刚需</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Llama 4 在公开榜单上表现惊人，在 Vals 的私有留出集上却是不达标——自报成绩和真实能力之间的裂缝，正在催生一个独立的评测行业。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI评测</span><span class=\"tag\">基准测试</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Meteorology (WEATHER &amp; CLIMATE) Encore with Marshall Shepherd Clausius-Clapeyron equation wet bulb globe temperature bombogenesis atmospheric river ENSO AMO\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-09-ologies-天气预报准确率-95-但没人相信它/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6714d8dbd3a57d1f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:16:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Ologies</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0909</span></div>\n<h2>天气预报准确率 95%，但没人相信它</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">气象学家说预报三到五天内有 95% 准确率，公众只记住被淋湿的那一次；气候不是未来时，是现在进行时。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">气象</span><span class=\"tag\">气候传播</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"How Gary Gulman Turned Depression Into Comedy Gold | Better in Person faux dementia Pomodoro method effective altruism\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-09-nostupid-喜剧演员把抑郁症变成-hbo-专场-靠的是每天打篮球/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ce8215f534d6978f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">47:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">No Stupid Questions</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0909</span></div>\n<h2>喜剧演员把抑郁症变成 HBO 专场，靠的是每天打篮球</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Gary Gulman 抑郁发作时每六到九个月丢掉三到六个月生产力，最后靠住院、吃药、每天运动和把病历写成段子，做出了 HBO 专场 The Great Depresh。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">心理健康</span><span class=\"tag\">创作方法</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How we built Grok Bot in a month | Roman Ugarte (SpaceXAI) MCP steering infovore unshipping\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-08-lennys-grok-bot-一个月做出来-小团队躲进山洞-大团队会拖没微决策/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/42cbfb013ec2988d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:22:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Lenny&#x27;s Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0908</span></div>\n<h2>Grok Bot 一个月做出来：小团队躲进山洞，大团队会拖没微决策</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">把知识工作做进 Cursor 不是显然错误，但用户能闻出三套愿景共用一块屏——那是把组织架构图直接发货。所以 Grok Bot 从零开始，几个人躲进山洞一个月。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>17</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span><span class=\"tag\">产品设计</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Sarah Longwell on How Democrats Can Defeat Trump focus group low-information voters Build Baby, Build\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-08-goodfight-特朗普的不可复制性-才是民主党真正的机会/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0908</span></div>\n<h2>特朗普的不可复制性，才是民主党真正的机会</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">特朗普的持久力来自几十年电视名人身份，别人学不来；民主党若把特朗普时代的教训当成通用规律，就会在2028年重蹈2024年的覆辙。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美国政治</span><span class=\"tag\">选举策略</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"OpenAI Researchers on the Future of Mathematical Reasoning sphere packing linear programming bound spherical code sofic group Aldous–Lyons conjecture harness\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-08-a16z-数学家怕-ai-写出千页证明-结果它只写了-15-页/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0908</span></div>\n<h2>数学家怕 AI 写出千页证明，结果它只写了 15 页</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">人类反证一个关于随机图的猜想，用了 250 页、还建立在另外 200 页之上；AI 在群论内部十几页就证出了更弱的那个结论。AI 的数学证明普遍短而优雅，长证明反倒只有人类写得出来。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">数学推理</span><span class=\"tag\">OpenAI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"147 ✪ SHEIN回港上市、新拼姆开启自营 Just-in-time Membersmark\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-08-fengtouquan-shein-回港上市-最强供应链壁垒反而成了软肋/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f4193533f4aa66ed-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"疯\"><span class=\"dur\">1:10:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">疯投圈</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0908</span></div>\n<h2>SHEIN 回港上市，最强供应链壁垒反而成了软肋</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">SHEIN 花很多年搭的供应链数据系统，是为了把下单到送达压到最快；但欧盟对小包开征关税之后，快在商业上不再成立，它一半以上的欧洲订单已经改从本地仓发货。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">跨境电商</span><span class=\"tag\">SHEIN</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Picky eating, protein, food dyes, and nutrition myths: What parents actually need to know with Jennifer Anderson ARFID rest and digest hyper palatable food health impact tiers\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-08-secureattach-孩子挑食别怪食物-先修关系-再谈营养/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ddcbe6658f0e30d7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">58:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Securely Attached</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0908</span></div>\n<h2>孩子挑食别怪食物：先修关系，再谈营养</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">喂养策略本身没那么重要，重要的是你怎么执行；父母先照顾好自己的食物关系，才是对孩子最有效的干预。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">儿童营养</span><span class=\"tag\">挑食</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Walter Russell Mead - How America Keeps Winning - [Invest Like the Best, EP.490] Tech Hamiltonian info-structure Jacksonian soft blockade\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-08-ilt-让对手依赖你的体系-是美国赢了三百年的秘密/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/aa91f50130802ffe-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:14:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Invest Like the Best</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0908</span></div>\n<h2>让对手依赖你的体系，是美国赢了三百年的秘密</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">荷兰、英国、美国轮番当老大，靠的不是封锁而是让对手把身家性命押进自己的海洋体系——等它们离不开航路与市场，切断就成了战争之外最有效的杀手锏。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中美博弈</span><span class=\"tag\">海洋霸权</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Is it time for a Luddite Renaissance? Luddite General Ned Ludd Enoch Frame Breaking Act\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-08-throughline-卢德分子不是反技术-是反失去议价权的自己/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c7f7bb336e16c273-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">16:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0908</span></div>\n<h2>卢德分子不是反技术，是反失去议价权的自己</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1812 年的卢德分子砸机器，是因为没有选票、没有工会，暴力是仅剩的谈判手段；今天自称新卢德分子的人有选票和言论自由，问题变成了要不要让技术重塑人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 与就业</span><span class=\"tag\">劳工史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Ep 221 Electroconvulsive Therapy Part 2: A current conversation Catatonia Anti-NMDA receptor encephalitis Succinylcholine Retrograde amnesia Transcranial magnetic stimulation (TMS)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-08-tpwky-ect-不是你想的那样-从密室到常规治疗的百年漂移/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/360c7ded98e41886-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">58:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Podcast Will Kill You</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0908</span></div>\n<h2>ECT 不是你想的那样：从密室到常规治疗的百年漂移</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">现代 ECT 是在麻醉和肌肉松弛剂下进行的程序，疗效显著，但有关记忆丧失的副作用证据仍不完全清楚，社会对此的误解导致它被过度污名化。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">精神科</span><span class=\"tag\">电休克疗法</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"288: How Do I Help My Disorganized Teen? executive functioning time blindness metacognition natural consequences\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-08-asklisa-孩子丢三落四不是懒-是前额叶还没长好/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/747ab52ea57af87e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">37:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Ask Lisa</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0908</span></div>\n<h2>孩子丢三落四不是懒，是前额叶还没长好</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">14岁男孩的前额叶要到25岁才发育完，所以丢三落四不是态度问题。真正的问题是：家长自己的执行功能也不够用，却要替孩子搭一套他根本撑不住的系统。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">青少年心理</span><span class=\"tag\">执行功能</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"End of the Day Crazies With Kids party hat / professional hat yes time\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-08-unruffled-孩子放学回家就发疯-不是他变坏了-是他终于安全了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1a571492f353e90a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">27:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Unruffled</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0908</span></div>\n<h2>孩子放学回家就发疯，不是他变坏了，是他终于安全了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">孩子把一天的压力全部倒给最亲的人，是正常且健康的；父母这时要戴的不是陪玩的「派对帽」，而是立规矩的「职业帽」，那才是真正的优质时间。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">育儿</span><span class=\"tag\">情绪调节</span>\n</div></div></a>"]